WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:01.880
Hey guys,&nbsp;

00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:06.680
You know in this day and age that&nbsp;
we live in, Christian men need to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:12.800
stand on God's word and believe in it.
Trust in it more than anything else.&nbsp;

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:17.680
We need men who live by God-confidence&nbsp;
and not self-confidence.&nbsp;

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:25.040
We are in a spiritual battle every day&nbsp;
and you cannot let up for even a second.&nbsp;

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:30.320
You need to put on the armor of God and&nbsp;
fight with truth against all the lies that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:33.560
are out there in the world.
All the distractions.&nbsp;

00:00:33.560 --> 00:00:40.840
And you need to run your race until the end.
To receive the crown of life.&nbsp;

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:45.960
But how can you fight if you don't know the truth?
God's Word?&nbsp;

00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:47.560
Do you know His word?
Do you read it?&nbsp;

00:00:47.560 --> 00:00:50.080
Do you study it?
Do you live it?&nbsp;

00:00:50.080 --> 00:00:55.080
Do you use it as part of the armor of&nbsp;
God to fight back against the devil?

